      "message": "fix(ui): build the OS quit request only where the macOS hook calls it\n\nReview of #334: request() is used only by the macOS terminate hook and\nthe tests, so on Windows/Linux non-test builds it was dead code under\nclippy -D warnings. Gate it with cfg(any(target_os = \"macos\", test)),\nand move mod os_quit into the egui_app module list's order.\n\nRefs #144\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
